#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:5 c37a6a27fddd4e929883b88238dab382
msgid "Tailsitter Planes"
msgstr "尾坐式飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:7 ee02c3a5ae1e4d89a2fe585444bfceee
msgid ""
"In ArduPilot tailsitters are any VTOL aircraft type that rotates the "
"fuselage (and autopilot) when moving between forward flight and hover."
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 中，尾坐式飞机是指在前飞和悬停之间转换时旋转机身（及飞控）的任何 VTOL 飞行器类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:10 a9dca1bd8bb24212beef8f59f4689fb1
msgid ""
"Despite the name, not all tailsitters land on their tails. Some are \"belly "
"landers\", where they lie down flat for landing to improve takeoff and "
"landing stability in wind. Some may have an undercarriage for wheeled "
"takeoff and others may have a stand or other landing aid."
msgstr ""
"顾名思义，并非所有尾坐式飞机都坐在尾部降落。有些是「腹部降落」飞机，在降落时平躺以提高在风中的起降稳定性。有些可能有轮式起落架，其他可能有支架或其他降落辅助装置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:15 be74aaef3aab4d2f8d23067832b0f938
msgid ""
"All tailsitters are considered types of QuadPlanes in ArduPilot. You should "
"start off by reading the :ref:`QuadPlane documentation <quadplane-support>` "
"before moving onto this tailsitter specific documentation."
msgstr ""
"所有尾坐式飞机在 ArduPilot 中均被视为 QuadPlane 类型。开始阅读本尾坐式专用文档之前，应先阅读 :ref:`QuadPlane 文档"
" <quadplane-support>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:20 953142bcebdd4eab92bcb2c4d516e61a
msgid ""
"Tailsitters and their parameters are enabled by setting "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` to either \"1\" ,for most "
"tailsitters, or \"2\" for the special case of Copter Motor Only Tailsitters "
"(those without control surfaces like elevons or ailerons/elevators)."
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` "
"设为「1」（大多数尾坐式）或「2」（仅电机尾坐式飞机的特殊情况，即没有升降副翼或副翼/升降舵等操纵面的飞机），可启用尾坐式飞机及其相关参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:23 1b4df33b60414097b63550cfb689754e
msgid "Vectored and non-Vectored"
msgstr "矢量推力与非矢量推力"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:25 15918163ba1945a4a4ccb0681f4c6a49
msgid "ArduPilot sub-divides tailsitters into two broad categories:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 将尾坐式飞机分为两大类："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:27 c226c2a9682c4a65bc94f8e362f79555
msgid ""
"Vectored tailsitters can tilt their rotors independently of the movement of "
"the fuselage, giving them vectored thrust"
msgstr "矢量推力尾坐式飞机可以独立于机身运动倾转转子，提供矢量推力"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:29 90273d280bcb4417be272cdd1fb48a73
msgid ""
"Non-vectored tailsitters have fixed rotor orientation relative to the "
"fuselage, and rely on large control surfaces for hover authority (although "
"dual motor versions can use differential thrust for body frame yaw control "
"also)"
msgstr "非矢量推力尾坐式飞机的转子相对于机身固定，依靠大型操纵面维持悬停控制权（双电机版本也可使用差速推力进行机体坐标系偏航控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:32 01acdec34df54e59a4a0a9e10b92789d
msgid ""
"Within Non-vectored are two sub-categories, Single/Dual Motor and "
"CopterMotor:"
msgstr "非矢量推力类型下又分为两个子类——单/双电机和多旋翼电机："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:34 4d51356e447e4f959631dbc3566d8bc9
msgid ""
"Single/Dual Motor uses one or two motors and can employ only differential "
"thrust if dual motor. Single motor tailsitters are similar to normal 3D "
"planes that can hover using large control surfaces exposed to the single "
"motor prop wash for control, but with ArduPilot providing the control "
"stability for hovering, loitering, and VTOL mission navigation. Dual Motor "
"add differential thrust to assist in body frame yaw control, while copter "
"motor tailsitters are almost the same as a multicopter when in VTOL stance "
"with flying surfaces, if present, adding to the control."
msgstr ""
"单/双电机使用一或两个电机，双电机情况下可使用差速推力。单电机尾坐式飞机类似于能够悬停的普通 3D "
"飞机，利用暴露在单电机螺旋桨气流中的大型操纵面进行控制，由 ArduPilot 提供悬停、盘旋和 VTOL "
"任务导航的控制稳定性。双电机增加了差速推力以辅助机体坐标系偏航控制；多旋翼电机尾坐式在 VTOL "
"状态下与多旋翼几乎相同，若有飞行操纵面则进一步增强控制能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:35 26be9f3a4e3f4a11b46756c7ec979272
msgid ""
"CopterMotor uses three, four, or more motors and operates in a more copter-"
"like fashion. These may or may not have control surfaces usable in fixed "
"wing flight for control. **               CopterMotor tailsitters without "
"them (ie. only have a lifting wing with no control surfaces) must always use"
" their motors to provide control while in fixed wing flight modes. Setting "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` = 2 automatically does this.**"
msgstr ""
"多旋翼电机使用三个、四个或更多电机，以更接近多旋翼的方式工作。这些飞机在固定翼飞行中可能有或没有可用的操纵面用于控制。**没有操纵面（即只有升力翼而无操纵面）的多旋翼电机尾坐式飞机在固定翼飞行模式下必须始终使用电机提供控制。将"
" :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` = 2 可自动实现这一点。**"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:38 51e533b4d65a46e58b7dc874d44523a7
msgid "Tailsitter Configuration"
msgstr "尾坐式飞机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:41 0684906c710a417c9111aff0565850fa
msgid "firmware versions 4.1 and earlier"
msgstr "固件版本 4.1 及更早版本"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:43 d74a924fb819460386dd0c17bf0e5d51
msgid ""
"The key to make a QuadPlane a tailsitter is to either set "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` =10 or "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` non-zero. That tells the QuadPlane "
"code to use the tailsitter VTOL backend."
msgstr ""
"使 QuadPlane 成为尾坐式飞机的关键是将 :ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` 设为 10，或将 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` 设为非零值。这将告知 QuadPlane 代码使用尾坐式 VTOL "
"后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:47 d61fed36c9a04a5c98489463cc9cec6c
msgid "firmware version 4.2 and later:"
msgstr "固件版本 4.2 及更高版本："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:49 2e4f31250e2c4011b394d87701d77ea7
msgid ""
"To make a QuadPlane a tailsitter is to set "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` to \"1\" or \"2\" to tell the "
"QuadPlane code to use the tailsitter VTOL backend."
msgstr ""
"使 QuadPlane 成为尾坐式飞机，需将 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` "
"设为「1」或「2」，以告知 QuadPlane 代码使用尾坐式 VTOL 后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:51 8e8e7a2bfa40446ba897e8454d9b95e0
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` is zero (the default), meaning no"
" multicopter-like motors, it provides roll, pitch, yaw and thrust (Throttle,"
" Throttle Left, Throttle Right) values to the fixed wing control code. These"
" values then control your ailerons, elevons, elevators, rudder and forward "
"motors."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` "
"为零（默认值），表示没有多旋翼风格电机，系统将向固定翼控制代码提供横滚、俯仰、偏航和推力（油门、左油门、右油门）值，这些值随后控制副翼、升降副翼、升降舵、方向舵和前向电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:53 49cd1a155de0491faac32e31d9007d8d
msgid ""
"This has a nice benefit when setting up the tailsitter that you can follow "
"the normal fixed wing setup guide in MANUAL and FBWA modes, and then when "
"you switch to hover all of your control directions will be correct."
msgstr ""
"这为尾坐式飞机的设置带来了一个好处：可以遵循正常的固定翼设置指南在 MANUAL 和 FBWA 模式下进行设置，切换到悬停时所有控制方向将自动正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:58 d03d7ecf90ac4c34b496b50c26641cf5
msgid ""
"It also means that you can fly any fixed wing aircraft that is capable of 3D"
" flight as a single or dual motor tailsitter, and fly it in modes like "
"QSTABILIZE, QHOVER and QLOITER."
msgstr ""
"这也意味着任何能够进行 3D 飞行的固定翼飞机都可以作为单电机或双电机尾坐式飞机运行，并在 QStabilize、QHover 和 QLoiter "
"等模式下飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:65 a8134941ba2945c3812616bf3baa9ce4
msgid ""
"However, it can also have copter-like motors, like a conventional QuadPlane "
"if :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` is non-zero. Then this parameter "
"determines which motors remain active in normal forward flight (plane "
"modes). If non-zero, then use the :ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` and "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` parameter to configure the multicopter "
"motor style, and the appropriate MOTORx outputs will be activated."
msgstr ""
"但若 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` 非零，也可以像传统 QuadPlane "
"一样拥有多旋翼风格电机。此参数决定在正常前飞（固定翼模式）中哪些电机保持活跃。若非零，则使用 "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` 和 :ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` "
"参数配置多旋翼电机布局，相应的 MOTORx 输出将被激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:67 9b0f4797213d46c3ad7bcfbc541016fc
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` determines the number and layout of VTOL"
" motors and :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` determines which motors "
"are active when in fixed wing modes, except in the special case of the "
"Copter Motor Only Tailsitter which keeps running the motors like a Copter "
"mode even when flying in a fixed wing mode for control surface-less Copter "
"tailsitters (ie always running the motors to provide attitude control, even "
"at low throttle)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` 决定 VTOL "
"电机的数量和布局，:ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` "
"决定固定翼模式下哪些电机保持活跃，但多旋翼电机仅尾坐式飞机的特殊情况除外——该类型即使在固定翼飞行模式下也像多旋翼模式一样持续运行电机，为没有操纵面的多旋翼尾坐式提供姿态控制（即始终运行电机以提供姿态控制，即使在低油门时也是如此）。"

