msgstr "NYT 四旋翼 X 电机尾坐式飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:121 67a4514f1bfb4bb5907057fdc66b5d46
msgid "Single/Dual Motor Tailsitter"
msgstr "单/双电机尾坐式飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:122 df732ca4ee5b46a9936d57456bf3d4ec
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` is zero and "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` =10, then the Single/Dual Motor "
"configuration is used. Motors may also be vectored using tilt servos, which "
"gives much higher control authority. If not vectored, these frames rely on "
"large control surfaces, exposed to the prop flow, in order to maintain "
"control. The motor layouts are shown below:"
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` 为零且 "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` = "
"10，则使用单/双电机配置。电机也可通过倾转舵机实现矢量化，从而获得更高的控制权。若无矢量化，这些机架依靠暴露在螺旋桨气流中的大型操纵面维持控制。电机布局如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:126 9ce92f979dd64a3ba28754e25e00d5bf
msgid ""
"Motors are controlled by the Throttle, Throttle Left, Throttle Right "
"outputs:"
msgstr "电机由油门、左油门、右油门输出控制："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:134 dea299d1bfef4907b70969bfe82cceb0
msgid "Autopilot Orientation"
msgstr "飞控方向"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:136 19ce7219a7c146b293fb7fd144424058
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`, the accelerometer calibration"
" and Level trim should all be done for fixed wing flight. Fixed wing flight "
"is considered \"normal\" orientation for a tailsitter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`、加速度计校准和水平调整均应针对固定翼飞行完成。固定翼飞行被视为尾坐式飞机的「正常」方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:140 a460e27035fa4196bd77a452fe8fd4cd
msgid ""
"when in VTOL flight the nose of the aircraft will try to point vertically "
"for \"level\" flight"
msgstr "VTOL 飞行时，飞机机头将尝试垂直指向以实现「水平」飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:142 6a2b3dcc824d4f29a054d25ca9bcb7f6
msgid ""
"when in fixed wing flight the nose of the aircraft will try to point "
"horizontally for \"level\" flight"
msgstr "固定翼飞行时，飞机机头将尝试水平指向以实现「水平」飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:146 2e1973fb01324e69bc87e3194112c88b
msgid "Key parameters"
msgstr "关键参数"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:148 1ad632e7774942d39adb636f0df3c165
msgid ""
"The key differences between fixed wing flight and VTOL for a tailsitter are:"
msgstr "尾坐式飞机固定翼飞行与 VTOL 的主要区别如下："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:151 280aa1870e3e4c989346c4a961980480
msgid ""
"when in VTOL the copter style PID gains will be used (the ones starting with"
" ``Q_A_RAT_x``)"
msgstr "VTOL 模式下将使用多旋翼风格的 PID 增益（以 ``Q_A_RAT_x`` 开头的参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:153 3248789098e04860bece03a3679c48fc
msgid ""
"when in fixed wing flight the fixed wing PID gains will be used (the "
"``RLL_RATE_x`` and ``PTCH_RATE_x`` gains)"
msgstr "固定翼飞行模式下将使用固定翼 PID 增益（``RLL_RATE_x`` 和 ``PTCH_RATE_x`` 增益）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:155 448b09dcf47e491e889f2e8a3b1d52fc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` allows the roll limit angle limit "
"to be set differently from :ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`. If left at "
"zero, both pitch and roll are limited by "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`. If "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` is nonzero roll angle will be "
"limited and pitch max angle will still be "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>`. This should be set if your tailsitter "
"can achieve much larger pitch angle than would be safe for roll (some "
"airframes can't recover from high-speed knife-edge flight using only yaw "
"control)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` 允许将横滚限制角度设置为与 "
":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>` 不同的值。若保持为零，俯仰和横滚均受 "
":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>` 限制。若 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` 非零，横滚角将受限，而最大俯仰角仍为 "
":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>`。若您的尾坐式飞机能达到比安全横滚角大得多的俯仰角（某些机架无法仅靠偏航控制从高速刀锋飞行中恢复），应设置此参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:156 b67c0844e5ed4b6aa807b5d5b44741cd
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` can be used to account for any offset in "
"hovering pitch angle due to the thrust line not being through the CG, or to "
"counter fixed wing AHRS trim used to set angle of attack in cruise, instead "
"of using :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` for adjusting the trim since it"
" is only in fixed modes and AHRS trim affects all modes. Set this such that "
"the vehicle does not drift forwards or backwards in QSTABILIZE or QHOVER "
"with no pilot inputs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` 可用于补偿因推力线不过重心或抵消固定翼 AHRS "
"俯仰调整（用于设置巡航时的迎角）而导致的悬停俯仰角偏差，而非使用仅在固定翼模式下有效的 "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` （因为 AHRS 调整会影响所有模式）。将此值设置为使飞行器在无飞手输入时 "
"QStabilize 或 QHover 模式下不向前或向后漂移。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:158 4c6b1fb5720f452e831cd4a21722d338
msgid ""
"After calibrating the accelerometers, using the \"LEVEL\" calibration "
"position as normal fixed wing flying attitude, you may find that the VTOL "
"nose up hover drifts to one side (ie earth frame roll), as well as front to "
"back. While there is a :ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` adjustment for "
"pitch trim, there is not for roll. You may use the \"LEVEL\" only calibrate "
"button in Mission Planner (the \"ahrstrim\" command in MAVProxy) to set the "
"pitch and roll trim while in Nose Up VTOL hover attitude, if you change the "
"mode to QSTABILIZE or QHOVER while doing so. This may change the fixed wing "
"pitch trim, but not the fixed wing roll trim. Therefore, you may have to re-"
"adjust the :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` parameter to get the desired "
"pitch attitude in fixed wing flight, as well as the "
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` value, but this should correct the side "
"drift."
msgstr ""
"校准加速度计（以正常固定翼飞行姿态作为「水平」校准位置）后，可能发现 VTOL 机头朝上悬停时向一侧漂移（即地球坐标系横滚），以及前后漂移。虽然有 "
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` 用于俯仰调整，但没有横滚调整。可在 QStabilize 或 QHover "
"模式下处于机头朝上 VTOL 悬停姿态时，使用 Mission Planner 中的「仅水平」校准按钮（MAVProxy "
"中的「ahrstrim」命令）设置俯仰和横滚调整。这可能改变固定翼俯仰调整但不改变横滚调整，因此可能需要重新调整 "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 参数以获得固定翼飞行中所需的俯仰姿态，以及调整 "
":ref:`Q_TRIM_PITCH<Q_TRIM_PITCH>` 值，但这应能修正侧漂。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:161 b81aa12855ab453da4ffafc6eb70e0d2
msgid "Vectored Thrust"
msgstr "矢量推力"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:163 2438587bf78b4ac08f97936f816c1749
msgid ""
"If your tailsitter has vectored thrust then you should set the "
"``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` values for your two tilt servos for the left and right "
"motors and for the left and right motor throttles."
msgstr "若尾坐式飞机有矢量推力，应为左右电机的两个倾转舵机设置 ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` 值，以及左右电机的油门输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:167 3dd31664c5384590bc503d371681fea0
msgid ""
"All tailsitters ignore the :ref:`Q_TILT_TYPE<Q_TILT_TYPE>` parameter, and "
"require continuous output servos, and will drive the tilt servos "
"appropriately."
msgstr "所有尾坐式飞机忽略 :ref:`Q_TILT_TYPE<Q_TILT_TYPE>` 参数，要求使用连续输出舵机，并将适当驱动倾转舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:169 2bc96312caf64bad991a13c5300e1151
msgid ""
"For example, if your left tilt servo is channel 5 and your right tilt servo "
"is channel 6, then set:"
msgstr "例如，若左倾转舵机在通道 5，右倾转舵机在通道 6，则设置："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:172 72f19e05a7194ad0a3c13e88b42d8486
msgid ":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` =75"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` =75"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:173 4dff3f4f886d471f9f63cfb8e9f85ccf
msgid ":ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` =76"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` =76"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:175 4ab5ab90f47a4dfb84ea2efd2f3292f8
msgid ""
"and you need to assign left throttle to the left motor and right throttle to"
" the right motor, for example using the SERVO 7 and SERVO 8 outputs, for "
"left and right motor escs, respectively:"
msgstr "还需为左右电机 ESC 分别分配左右油门，例如使用 SERVO 7 和 SERVO 8 输出："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:177 e7e2b25f1bf24ac699395c94e1f296a2
msgid ":ref:`SERVO7_FUNCTION<SERVO7_FUNCTION>` =73"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO7_FUNCTION<SERVO7_FUNCTION>` =73"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:178 2958fbffc9104ed0804fd8ddb2dff310
msgid ":ref:`SERVO8_FUNCTION<SERVO8_FUNCTION>` =74"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO8_FUNCTION<SERVO8_FUNCTION>` =74"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:180 4384bb937a6041218f8a7557ee29cba2
msgid ""
"You also need to set the right ``SERVOn_REVERSED`` values, and the correct "
"``SERVOn_TRIM``, ``SERVOn_MIN`` and ``SERVOn_MAX`` values, as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"还需根据实际情况设置正确的 ``SERVOn_REVERSED`` 值，以及正确的 ``SERVOn_TRIM``、``SERVOn_MIN`` 和 "
"``SERVOn_MAX`` 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:183 a15dff31dd99469c94f9cc7197d60428
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_BOOST<Q_A_ANGLE_BOOST>` should be disabled for vectored "
"thrust tailsitters. Failure to disable this will cause the throttle to "
"decrease as the nose dips, making the nose dip even further and resulting in"
" a crash."
msgstr ""
"矢量推力尾坐式飞机应禁用 "
":ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_BOOST<Q_A_ANGLE_BOOST>`。未禁用此选项将导致机头下倾时油门减小，使机头进一步下倾，最终坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:185 d64f2b678ade46b199a18a363ff2ed99
msgid ""
"When disarmed, switching to QHOVER or QLOITER will force the motors forward "
"into fixed wing orientation. If armed in this position, a prop strike could "
"occur for Belly Sitter configurations. Tilt will be raised to VTOL position "
"when throttle is raised above idle, but the strike will have already "
"occurred. The solution is to momentarily raise the throttle above idle, "
"allowing the tilts to raise, return throttle stick to idle, then arm. This "
"needs to be done also for AUTO mode takeoffs, which should be started from "
"QSTABILIZE with motors raised, armed, and then change to AUTO for the "
"takeoff."
msgstr ""
"未解锁状态下，切换到 QHover 或 QLoiter "
"将强制电机向前倾转至固定翼方向。若在此位置解锁，腹部降落式配置可能发生螺旋桨碰地。当油门升至怠速以上时倾转将抬起至 VTOL "
"位置，但此时碰地已经发生。解决方案是短暂将油门升至怠速以上，待倾转抬起后将油门摇杆恢复到怠速，再解锁。AUTO 模式起飞也需如此操作，应在 "
"QStabilize 模式下提起电机并解锁，再切换到 AUTO 执行起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:188 212d99e013034c2093c46bce4141477b
msgid "Tilt Rotor Movement Setup"
msgstr "倾转旋翼运动设置"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:189 707b952e7da24bf0835252b98f446cab
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Tilt Rotor Setup Tips<tilt-rotor-tips>` and :ref:`Tilt Rotor Servo"
" Setup<tilt-rotor-setup>`"
msgstr ""
"参见 :ref:`倾转旋翼设置技巧<tilt-rotor-tips>` 和 :ref:`倾转旋翼舵机设置<tilt-rotor-setup>`"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:194 6dba2c02e5514c6e8fb02a0cc878bfef
msgid "TVBS (Thrust Vectored Belly Sitter)"
msgstr "TVBS（矢量推力腹部坐落式）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:196 1fcccb4a2978488695043a3f9ff7dcda
msgid ""
"TVBS are just dual motor vectored thrust tailsitters that don't sit on their"
" tails, but rather their belly. Aside from making sure props clear (ie "
"sufficient throw on tilt servos) when in the horizontal stance, nothing "
"special is required to make it take off from a horizontal stance."
msgstr ""
"TVBS "
"即不坐在尾部而坐在腹部降落的双电机矢量推力尾坐式飞机。除确保螺旋桨在水平姿态时不碰地（即倾转舵机有足够的行程）外，无需特殊处理即可实现从水平姿态起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:198 9374a188b0a94931a432f6857ad33b5d
msgid ""
"At least 45 degree throw, either side of neutral (fixed wing flight "
"position) is required, with 60 degrees being most desirable. Otherwise, the "
"vehicle will \"skid\" along the ground a bit when you raise the throttle to "
"bring it vertical on takeoff. Takeoffs, required a decisive move of throttle"
" to hover or above to reduce the \"skid\"."
msgstr ""
"中立位置（固定翼飞行位置）两侧至少需要 45 度的行程，最佳为 60 "
"度。否则提高油门使飞机垂直起飞时，飞行器将在地面上「滑行」一段。起飞时需果断大幅推油门至悬停或以上，以减少「滑行」。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:202 b419ded707f84947b0da31fbae1a34db
msgid ""
"For landing in fixed wing, manual throttle controlled modes, there is an "
"``RCx_OPTION`` (89) that will force the tilt servos upright at idle "
"throttle, and optionally force the pitch to target "
":ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG<LAND_PITCH_DEG>` for flaring to the normal fixed wing "
"landing. This allows intentional or emergency fixed wing landings in MANUAL,"
" ACRO, STABILIZE, and FBWA modes without the risk of a prop strike in "
"configurations where this could occur otherwise."
msgstr ""
"对于固定翼手动油门控制模式的降落，有一个 ``RCx_OPTION`` （89）可在怠速时强制倾转舵机直立，并可选择强制俯仰目标为 "
":ref:`LAND_PITCH_DEG<LAND_PITCH_DEG>` 以便在正常固定翼降落中拉平。这允许在 "
"MANUAL、ACRO、Stabilize 和 FBWA 模式下进行有意或紧急固定翼降落，而不会在可能发生碰地的配置中产生螺旋桨碰地风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:205 8422b25461a84cffa6e402332dd04c01
msgid "Vectored Gains"
msgstr "矢量增益"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:207 cafbb8d2578e47058c2c014395d29ed5
msgid ""
"There are two vectoring gains available. One controls the amount of vectored"
" thrust movement in hover, and the other controls the amount of vectored "
"thrust movement in forward flight."
msgstr "有两个矢量增益可用，一个控制悬停中的矢量推力运动量，另一个控制前飞中的矢量推力运动量。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:211 b07391cd84534b71a227942963a4979a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN>` parameter controls vectored "
"thrust in hover. A typical value is around 0.8, which gives a lot of control"
" to vectored thrust in hover. This control is combined with control from "
"your elevon mixing gain (controlled by :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>`)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN>` 参数控制悬停时的矢量推力，典型值约为 "
"0.8，使悬停时矢量推力有较大的控制权，该控制与升降副翼混控增益（由 :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 控制）结合。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:216 9fc7153fe6324d5a9a6f59cd98e6fdbd
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN>` parameter controls vectored "
"thrust in forward flight. A typical value is around 0.2, which gives a small"
" amount of control to vectored thrust in forward flight. This control is "
"combined with control from your elevon mixing gain (controlled by "
":ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>`)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN>` 参数控制前飞时的矢量推力，典型值约为 "
"0.2，使前飞时矢量推力有较小的控制权，该控制与升降副翼混控增益（由 :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 控制）结合。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:221 819c6543b7ae4bb6a8ad7a88ddc6f735
msgid ""
"By adjusting the relative values of "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN>`, "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN>` and "
":ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` you can adjust how much control you have "
"from elevons and thrust vectoring in each flight mode."
msgstr ""
"通过调整 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VHGAIN>`、:ref:`Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN<Q_TAILSIT_VFGAIN>`"
" 和 :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 的相对值，可以调整各飞行模式下来自升降副翼和矢量推力的控制量。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:229 40ca145802bd4f37af1f2a71e245b560
msgid "CopterMotor PID Gain Scaling"
msgstr "多旋翼电机 PID 增益调整"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:231 7beb393ba4a848c28e5c69fb7ee65630
msgid ""
"There are a number of options for scaling control surface movement versus "
"speed. Control surface effectiveness is dependent on airspeed they see, in "
"tailsitter configurations this is heavily driven by the motor layout and "
"prop wash. A copter tailsitter with lots of control authority from thrust "
"and small control surfaces will be much less sensitive to these gain "
"scheduling parameters. For a vehicle with large control surfaces care must "
"be taken to setup gain scaling to best suit the configuration."
msgstr ""
"有多种选项用于相对于速度对操纵面运动进行缩放调整。操纵面效能取决于其感受到的空速，在尾坐式配置中，这在很大程度上由电机布局和螺旋桨气流决定。拥有大量推力控制权和小型操纵面的多旋翼尾坐式飞机对这些增益调度参数的敏感性要低得多。对于拥有大型操纵面的飞行器，必须仔细设置增益缩放以最适合该配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:234 eea8d4c780a8452f80cd901361b7d9de
msgid ""
"The gain scaling scheme is selected with "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK>`, it is a bitmask, some options can"
" be used in combination, others must be used in isolation."
msgstr ""
"增益缩放方案通过 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK>` "
"参数选择，这是一个位掩码，部分选项可以组合使用，其他选项必须单独使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:236 789debdd2abf4253982f735a51204804
msgid ""
"The maximum and minimum scaling that can be applied by any scheme is set by "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMIN<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMIN>` and "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMAX<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMAX>`. If a scheme is working well at "
"all but the extremes these endpoints can be adjusted."
msgstr ""
"任何方案可施加的最大和最小缩放量由 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMIN<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMIN>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMAX<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMAX>` 设置。若某方案在除极端值外的所有情况下都运行良好，可调整这些端点。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:238 60da0c16c92b4609a47ed2741a366250
msgid ""
"Scaling is done relative the hover throttle point, ensure this is set "
"correctly before proceeding, see: :ref:`Flight Modes<quadplane-flight-"
"modes>`, QHOVER mode."
msgstr ""
"缩放是相对于悬停油门点进行的，在继续操作前请确保此设置正确，参见：:ref:`Flight Modes<quadplane-flight-"
"modes>`，QHOVER 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:240 71acaf6d85b547009a1c068e4785d2e5
msgid ""
"Disk theory gain scaling is the most advanced method available and should "
"result in the best results, if setup correctly."
msgstr "圆盘理论增益缩放是目前最先进的方法，如果设置正确，应能获得最佳效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:243 b03c6db6cf2349ce8efbb203441b87cb
msgid "Throttle scaling (Bit 0)"
msgstr "油门缩放（位 0）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:245 9e906fbf1d944f48909fd697ba748fa9
msgid ""
"Control surfaces will be scaled directly with throttle. High throttle will "
"result in less control surface movement, low throttle will result in more. "
"This method is always used for thrust vectoring scaling in non-CopterMotor "
"tailsitters independent of :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK>`."
msgstr ""
"控制舵面将直接随油门缩放。高油门时舵面偏转量减小，低油门时舵面偏转量增大。此方法始终用于非 CopterMotor 尾坐式飞机的推力矢量缩放，与 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK<Q_TAILSIT_GSCMSK>` 无关。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:248 6e2fff7e550d46e7a75fc8ebd2666724
msgid "Reduce gain at high throttle/tilt (Bit 1)"
msgstr "在高油门/倾斜时减小增益（位 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:250 70a3ae257d8b40dea7b5ca930ce4dc69
msgid ""
"Attitude/throttle based gain attenuation, with this option control surface "
"deflection is reduced at high tilt angles and high throttle levels to "
"prevent oscillation at high airspeeds. This can be used in combination with "
"throttle scaling."
msgstr "基于姿态/油门的增益衰减，启用此选项后，在高倾斜角和高油门水平下控制舵面偏转量减小，以防止在高空速下产生震荡。可与油门缩放组合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:253 821e981496924bc38562e289c1d579be
msgid "Disk theory (Bit 2)"
msgstr "圆盘理论（位 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:254 410b8d245c344f2fa0fa42fce3d55bb9
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Disk theory gain scaling attempts to calculate the airspeed seen on the "
"control surfaces as a result of both prop wash and forward airspeed. In "
"order for this calculation to be done "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD<Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD>` must be set. This is the aircraft "
"weight in KG divided by the total disk area of the propellers. The disk area"
" for each propeller is calculated from the radius, the disk area of all "
"propellers should then be summed. This allows ArduPilot to calculate the "
"airspeed directly behind the propeller, however on a real vehicle 100% of "
"the control surface is not in the direct prop wash."
msgstr ""
"圆盘理论增益缩放尝试计算由螺旋桨洗流和前向空速共同作用于控制舵面的空速。为进行此计算，必须设置 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD<Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD>`，即飞机重量（千克）除以螺旋桨总盘面积。每个螺旋桨的盘面积由半径计算得出，然后将所有螺旋桨的盘面积求和。这使"
" ArduPilot 能够计算螺旋桨正后方的空速，但在实际飞行器上，控制舵面并非 100% 处于直接螺旋桨洗流中。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:257 a63d98478a9444a4bf45fdd744699d9f
msgid ""
"For example if half of the control surfaces are in the prop wash the "
"calculated disk loading value should also be halved. Some tuning will be "
"required for best performance, If oscillations are seen at high throttle "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD<Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD>` should be reduced."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果一半控制舵面处于螺旋桨洗流中，则计算出的圆盘载荷值也应减半。为获得最佳性能，需要进行一些调参。如果在高油门下出现震荡，应减小 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD<Q_TAILSIT_DSKLD>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:259 466172725ff14030be6dfa9143621fc6
msgid "For best results an airspeed sensor should be fitted."
msgstr "为获得最佳结果，应安装空速传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:264 47c55e1df4aa43d6baa5f4b0ef00e070
msgid "Altitude correction (Bit 3)"
msgstr "高度修正（位 3）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:266 f95dc73eb7c4469e91fe9dd0ee13c078
msgid ""
"Gain is scaled with altitude, this should be considered when operating over "
"a wide range of altitudes, this method can be enabled in combination with "
"any other method."
msgstr "增益随高度缩放，在大范围高度飞行时应考虑此选项，此方法可与任何其他方法组合启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:269 dfa0f1e6cf5b446b934403424985dffe
msgid "Transitions"
msgstr "过渡"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:271 ac49903be873483b9cf6d8b526374043
msgid ""
"Tailsitter transitions are a little different than other QuadPlane "
"transitions."
msgstr "尾坐式飞机的过渡与其他 QuadPlane 过渡略有不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:273 0a9509a657384eb7a8320da33326f568
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE<Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE>` specifies how far the nose must "
"pitch down in a VTOL mode before transition to forward flight is complete. "
"So a value of e.g. 60 degrees results in switching from copter to plane "
"controller (forward transition) when the nose reaches 30 degrees above the "
"horizon (60 degrees down from vertical). The pitch rate used when pitching "
"down to forward flight is given by "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RAT_FW<Q_TAILSIT_RAT_FW>`, this rate will be held until "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE<Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE>` is reached."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE<Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE>` 指定在 VTOL "
"模式下机头必须俯仰多少度才能完成向前飞行的过渡。例如，60 度的值意味着当机头达到水平面以上 30 度（即从垂直方向向下 60 "
"度）时，从多旋翼控制器切换到固定翼控制器（前向过渡）。向前飞行俯仰时的俯仰速率由 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RAT_FW<Q_TAILSIT_RAT_FW>` 给出，此速率将保持到达到 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE<Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE>` 为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:276 d38be6c0a1e84f81b6559b3b1d1c3908
msgid ""
"For the back transition from forward flight to VTOL, the plane controller "
"will be used until the nose reaches "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT<Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT>` above the horizon. If "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT<Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT>` is 0 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE<Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE>` will be used for both forward and "
"back transitions. The pitch rate used when pitching up to VTOL flight is "
"given by :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RAT_VT<Q_TAILSIT_RAT_VT>`, this rate will be held "
"until :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT<Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT>` is reached."
msgstr ""
"对于从前向飞行返回 VTOL 的反向过渡，将使用固定翼控制器，直到机头达到水平面以上 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT<Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT>` 度。如果 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT<Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT>` 为 0，则 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE<Q_TAILSIT_ANGLE>` 将用于前向和反向过渡。俯仰至 VTOL 飞行时的俯仰速率由 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RAT_VT<Q_TAILSIT_RAT_VT>` 给出，此速率将保持到达到 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT<Q_TAILSIT_ANG_VT>` 为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:279 6d8539cd5e01491f91d65b014b596cc1
msgid ""
"if you back transition while on the ground, ie sitting in a FW mode at zero "
"throttle, armed, and then switch to a VTOL mode, the motors will immediately"
" start spinning until the \"transition\" completes and the motors tilt up. "
"This can result in ground movement. To help prevent this, you can set "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 18 to prevent arming unless already in a "
"VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"如果在地面上进行反向过渡，即在零油门、已解锁的固定翼模式下静止，然后切换到 VTOL "
"模式，电机将立即开始旋转，直到「过渡」完成且电机向上倾斜。这可能导致地面移动。为防止此情况，可设置 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 18，以防止在非 VTOL 模式下解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:281 90d46776b8ca4200a03b89b6ed7116a7
msgid ""
"Depending on the entry speed and time required to transition, the vehicle "
"may gain altitude, sometimes significantly, since the throttle is set to the"
" current :ref:`Q_M_THRST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` hover thrust value "
"throughout the transition to VTOL. This can be overridden with a lower value"
" by setting :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_THR_VT<Q_TAILSIT_THR_VT>`. With experimentation,"
" changing the rates, angle, and this parameter for fixed wing to VTOL "
"transitions, it is possible to obtain almost level altitude transitions. "
"Especially with copter style tailsitters with no control surfaces using "
"Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE = 2, keeping attitude control active even at low or zero "
"throttle values."
msgstr ""
"根据进入速度和过渡所需时间，飞行器在过渡到 VTOL 全程中油门设置为当前 :ref:`Q_M_THRST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>`"
" 悬停推力值，因此可能获得显著的高度增加。可通过设置 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_THR_VT<Q_TAILSIT_THR_VT>` "
"来以较低值覆盖此设置。通过反复试验，调整速率、角度以及固定翼到 VTOL "
"过渡的此参数，可实现几乎平稳的高度过渡。特别是对于无控制舵面的直升机式尾坐飞机，使用 Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE = "
"2，即使在低油门或零油门值下也保持姿态控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:283 9fdddd267fc44ce49988cac6816569e9
msgid ""
"During transitions, pilot input is disabled and vehicle attitude and "
"throttle is controlled totally by the autopilot."
msgstr "过渡期间，飞行员输入被禁用，飞行器的姿态和油门完全由飞控控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:285 138d9ddc089b467da868feee2d1a706a
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will send as message to the GCS when transition is complete, these"
" can be found in the Mission Planner messages tab. If the transition does "
"not complete normally the transition parameters and vehicle tune should be "
"checked. A example message is ```Transition FW done, timeout```, the timeout"
" time is one and a half times the expected transition time as calculated "
"from the angle and rate parameters."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将在过渡完成时向地面站发送消息，这些消息可在 Mission Planner "
"消息标签页中找到。如果过渡未正常完成，应检查过渡参数和飞行器调参情况。示例消息为 ``Transition FW done, "
"timeout``，超时时间为根据角度和速率参数计算的预期过渡时间的 1.5 倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:288 e0fb2bd1ee844f1dad34c52aaf8491de
msgid "Control Surfaces"
msgstr "控制舵面"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:290 67349ef17a0e405aa87200ffd55f31b8
msgid ""
"Although usually not recommended, it is possible to fly a tailsitter "
"aircraft with no control surfaces. Care should be taken to get the vehicle "
"flying well in the hover modes first."
msgstr "虽然通常不建议，但可以在没有控制舵面的情况下飞行尾坐式飞机。应注意先在悬停模式下让飞行器飞行良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:292 0991cbaaa73f46ca9c72b959328527e3
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 7:Force Qassist will force the vehicle to "
"use the copter controller in all flight modes."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 7：Force Qassist 将强制飞行器在所有飞行模式下使用多旋翼控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:293 6f6cc53f079949ffab28825334d0d7b6
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 8:Mtrs_Only_Qassist allows use of the copter"
" controller for the motors but leave any controls surfaces under plane "
"control, this allows the control surfaces to act as 'trim tabs' for the "
"motors."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 8：Mtrs_Only_Qassist "
"允许为电机使用多旋翼控制器，但将任何控制舵面保留在固定翼控制下，使控制舵面充当电机的「配平片」。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:295 753c4e0dbfd64db29d6dc2292c6500c1
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Assisted Fixed-Wing Flight<assisted_fixed_wing_flight>` for more "
"details on how Qassist can be automatically enabled and disabled with "
"airspeed, altitude, attitude, and/or by ``RCx_OPTION`` switch."
msgstr ""
"参见 :ref:`Assisted Fixed-Wing Flight<assisted_fixed_wing_flight>` 了解更多关于 "
"Qassist 如何通过空速、高度、姿态和/或 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关自动启用和禁用的详细信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:298 ba70a72603f94a4d81401712ec378903
msgid "Tailsitter Input"
msgstr "尾坐式输入"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:300 2711beb27560439ebb785f33cdc4e5cb
msgid ""
"You can change how control inputs while hovering a tailsitter will be "
"interpreted using the :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` parameter. The"
" choices are:"
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` 参数更改悬停尾坐式飞机时控制输入的解释方式。选项如下："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:303 7f715ea93f834599a8c05eb1982fc658
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` =0 means that in hover the aircraft "
"responds like a multi-rotor, with the yaw stick controlling earth-frame yaw,"
" and roll stick controlling earth-frame roll. This is a good choice for "
"pilots who are used to flying multi-rotor aircraft."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` =0 "
"表示悬停时飞机响应类似多旋翼，偏航摇杆控制地球系偏航，横滚摇杆控制地球系横滚。对于习惯飞行多旋翼飞机的飞手来说是个好选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:308 81553f60aabb47219b1339708ea3c65f
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` =1 means that in hover the aircraft "
"responds like a 3D aircraft, with the yaw stick controlling earth-frame "
"roll, and roll stick controlling earth-frame yaw. This is a good choice for "
"pilots who are used to flying 3D aircraft in prop-hang, but is not very "
"useful when flying around, due to the earth-frame multicopter control "
"inputs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` =1 表示悬停时飞机响应类似 3D "
"飞机，偏航摇杆控制地球系横滚，横滚摇杆控制地球系偏航。对于习惯在螺旋桨悬挂中飞行 3D "
"飞机的飞手来说是好选择，但在四处飞行时用处不大，因为是地球系多旋翼控制输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:314 4c237bd2c258461186f3d03dd1e5357e
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` =2 and 3 mean that the aircraft "
"responds like a 3D aircraft with the yaw stick controlling earth-frame yaw "
"and the roll stick controlling body-frame roll when flying level. When "
"hovering, these options behave the same as types 0 and 1, respectively. This"
" is accomplished by splitting the roll and yaw command inputs into bodyframe"
" roll and yaw components as a function of Euler pitch."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` =2 和 3 表示飞机响应类似 3D "
"飞机，水平飞行时偏航摇杆控制地球系偏航，横滚摇杆控制机体系横滚。悬停时，这些选项分别与类型 0 和 1 "
"行为相同。这通过将横滚和偏航命令输入分解为作为欧拉俯仰角函数的机体系横滚和偏航分量来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:320 cec0ffa6dcf14f9d9df8f92e1f8719cf
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Due to the rotation of the tailsitter body frame with respect to the "
"multicopter body frame, the roll limits are set by parameter "
":ref:`Q_YAW_RATE_MAX<Q_YAW_RATE_MAX>` (in degrees), and the yaw rate limits "
"are set by parameter :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` (in deg/sec)."
"  The pitch limit is set by parameter :ref:`Q_A_ANGLE_MAX<Q_A_ANGLE_MAX>` "
"(in degrees), and this also serves as the yaw rate limit if "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` is zero. If any rate limit is too "
"high for the airframe, you may experience glitches in attitude control at "
"high rates."
msgstr ""
"由于尾坐式机体坐标系相对于多旋翼机体坐标系的旋转，横滚限制由参数 :ref:`Q_YAW_RATE_MAX<Q_YAW_RATE_MAX>` "
"（度）设定，偏航速率限制由参数 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` （度/秒）设定。俯仰限制由参数 "
":ref:`Q_ANGLE_MAX<Q_ANGLE_MAX>` （度）设定，如果 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX<Q_TAILSIT_RLL_MX>` "
"为零，此值也用作偏航速率限制。如果任何速率限制对机架而言过高，在高速率时可能出现姿态控制异常。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:322 5b7f55cfe9d243aa82d956899e6e5201
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` is ignored in QACRO modes. All "
"inputs are body-frame referenced."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_INPUT<Q_TAILSIT_INPUT>` 在 QACRO 模式下被忽略。所有输入均以机体系为参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:325 30c10953915a4b148e203a033a2b51ea
msgid "Tailsitter Input Mask"
msgstr "尾坐式输入掩码"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:327 a45140495e544d8aa048322e5437f955
msgid ""
"Use of this feature is not recommended since its removed in 4.2 and  later "
"firmware revisions"
msgstr "不建议使用此功能，因为它已在 4.2 及更高版本固件中移除。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:330 de36820454654d31a45dce760a29d2e2
msgid ""
"To support people with experience flying 3D aircraft and wanting to learn "
"how to prop-hang manually, you can set the "
"``Q_TAILSIT_MASK<Q_TAILSIT_MASK>`` to determine which channels will have "
"full manual input control without attitude stabilization while hovering in "
"QHOVER and QSTABILIZE."
msgstr ""
"为了支持有 3D 飞机飞行经验并希望学习手动螺旋桨悬挂的用户，可以设置 ``Q_TAILSIT_MASK<Q_TAILSIT_MASK>`` 以确定在 "
"QHOVER 和 QSTABILIZE 悬停时哪些通道将在无姿态稳定的情况下获得完全手动输入控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:334 1690979301df4b9ba83b9478f3543376
msgid ""
"The mask of manual channels is enabled using a transmitter input channel, "
"specified with the ``Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH<Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH>`` parameter."
msgstr "手动通道掩码通过遥控器输入通道启用，由 ``Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH<Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH>`` 参数指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:337 f4ae858eaffc427e955a9a84ba6c787f
msgid ""
"For example, if you are learning how to fly 3D aircraft, and you want some "
"assistance learning how to best control the rudder, then you can set:"
msgstr "例如，如果您正在学习飞行 3D 飞机，并希望获得一些学习如何最佳控制方向舵的辅助，则可以设置："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:341 d96efb873d1c477799ad379f74686f2f
msgid "``Q_TAILSIT_MASK<Q_TAILSIT_MASK>`` =8 (for rudder)"
msgstr "``Q_TAILSIT_MASK<Q_TAILSIT_MASK>`` =8（用于方向舵）"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:342 09595e9886df4a8881e5f451074adeac
msgid "``Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH<Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH>`` =7"
msgstr "``Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH<Q_TAILSIT_MASKCH>`` =7"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:344 70d679df848349d581e0ae1878b9a261
msgid ""
"then when channel 7 goes above 1700 the pilot will be given full manual "
"control of rudder when hovering. This provides good 3D piloting practice on "
"one or more axes at a time."
msgstr "当通道 7 超过 1700 时，飞行员将在悬停时获得方向舵的完全手动控制。这提供了良好的 3D 飞行练习，可以同时在一个或多个轴上进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:349 b86d73195d9a4ea891e895a04e58fc18
msgid "Center of Gravity"
msgstr "重心"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:351 c60b808430d043c9a3e492e402c3759e
msgid ""
"The center of gravity for a tailsitter is important in an extra dimension. "
"When hovering it is important that there is not too much weight in the belly"
" of the plane or on its back, so that it leans forward or back. This is "
"particularly important for non-vectored tailsitters."
msgstr "尾坐式飞机的重心在额外维度上很重要。悬停时，重要的是机腹或背部不能有过多重量，否则会向前或向后倾斜。这对于非矢量推力尾坐式飞机尤为重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:358 6cf2f2184b0243aa98e862198e53a1d4
msgid "Pre-Arm Issues"
msgstr "解锁前问题"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:360 fec71faa656a48078123f5323b56a7d6
msgid ""
"Due to an issue in DCM related to compass fusion for yaw when pointing "
"straight up, sometimes the AHRS subsystems will disagree when powering up, "
"nose up. Slight errors in compass calibration, while resulting in a "
"successful calibration, may worsen this effect."
msgstr ""
"由于 DCM 中与朝正上方时偏航的罗盘融合相关的问题，有时在机头朝上加电时，AHRS "
"子系统会出现不一致。罗盘校准中的轻微误差虽然校准成功，但可能会加剧此效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:362 2666d57c8efc468ebd5d2b21f35d89f6
msgid ""
"The result is that some setups will give a pre-arm failure. Typically it is "
"\"Pre-Arm:DCM roll/pitch inconsistent by \"x\" degrees\" or similar. If this"
" happens consistently, then one of two solutions can be used:"
msgstr ""
"结果是某些设置会出现解锁前失败。通常是「Pre-Arm:DCM roll/pitch inconsistent by 「x」 "
"degrees」或类似提示。如果此情况持续出现，可以使用以下两种解决方案之一："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:364 76cfb2a254744a42bb1252ce6e47ac4e
msgid ""
"Power up horizontally, and allow the autopilot to begin initialization in "
"this position. After the IMUs tilt initialization is completed (usually in "
"the first ten to fifteen seconds or so), the Tailsitter can be set "
"vertically for the remainder of the initialization (ie after GPS lock and "
"EKF is using the GPS) and then armed."
msgstr ""
"水平加电，让飞控在此位置开始初始化。在 IMU 倾斜初始化完成后（通常在前十到十五秒左右），可以将尾坐式飞机竖直放置，完成剩余初始化（即在 GPS "
"锁定且 EKF 使用 GPS 之后），然后解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:365 70f8e7fda3f44f07a515bc247170852f
msgid ""
"Or, if you get the Pre-Arm failure above, lay the Tailsitter down "
"horizontally for 10-30 seconds to allow the various AHRS subsystems to "
"synchronize. After that it can be raised and arming should proceed normally."
msgstr "或者，如果出现上述解锁前失败，将尾坐式飞机水平放置 10-30 秒，让各种 AHRS 子系统同步。之后即可竖直放置，解锁应可正常进行。"
